@url=http://localhost:3000

###lista de vehiculos

GET {{url}}/vehiculos

###

GET {{url}}/vehiculos/2

###
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?marca=a


###
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?modelo=a


###
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?patente=a

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### crear vehiculo
POST {{url}}/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

